't include `firefox` in the decision task index; r=dustin,mshal,rail,Callek a=release\n\nThe decision task is used for everything built as part of a push (for\nmozilla-central, this is firefox, devedition and fennec, as well as tasks that\naren't strictly part of any product). Thus, having `firefox` encoded as part of\nthe decision task doesn't make sense.\n\nThis changes the route from\n    index.gecko.v2.${repository.project}.latest.firefox.decision\nto\n    index.gecko.v2.${repository.project}.latest.taskgraph.decision\nwhile leaving the latter for backwards compatability with tools that expect it.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D996", "files": [".taskcluster.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "f36ff7dcaaebe1336c8526331dc67af895f110de", "parents": ["871c3aebfab8323d0b862996dbedb7f7e4b390a8"], "tags": []}], "date": 1524534425, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "mozilla@hocat.ca"}, "7647": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug, Automated HSTS preload list update from host bld-linux64-spot-303 - a=hsts-update", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.errors", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "c20a124749ed35ef1015cc2443a2800db04a3dca", "parents": ["f36ff7dcaaebe1336c8526331dc67af895f110de"], "tags": []}, {"author": "ffxbld", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug, Automated HPKP preload list update from host bld-linux64-spot-303 - a=hpkp-update", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "f5d8bcffa0d2ad430416e0d23e12cd11cfc92c68", "parents": ["c20a124749ed35ef1015cc2443a2800db04a3dca"], "tags": []}], "date": 1524604312, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "7648": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug, Automated HSTS preload list update from host bld-linux64-spot-303 - a=hsts-update", "files": ["securi